                <pb facs="0909" n="897" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg897"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890F.515/44a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Egypt</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-09-10T23:00:00-04:00">September 10,
                            1943—11 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1323. From Treasury for Gunter. Please repeat to Jidda. For your information: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>We are trying to arrange that the United Kingdom shall pay both the
                            minting costs and the transportation costs for the initial 8 million
                            riyals in return for a reciprocal lend-lease credit from the United
                            States. This Government will extend to Saudi Arabia as additional
                            lend-lease aid by this Government the minting and transportation costs
                            for any riyals coined here.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>The riyals minted in India and in London are to be delivered to Moose
                            and presented by him to the appropriate officials of Saudi Arabia. The
                            State Department will determine the appropriate officials to sign the
                            receipts on behalf of Saudi Arabia upon delivery of the riyals.
                            [Treasury.]</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
